## 2. Complete Technology Stack & APIs

| Layer | Technology / Package | Version / Config | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Runtime** | Python | 3.11+ (running 3.13.2) | Primary execution environment |
| **API Framework** | FastAPI + Uvicorn | 0.115+ | High-performance async REST & SSE endpoints |
| **Validation & Schemas** | Pydantic / Pydantic-Settings | v2 | Request/response envelopes, agent structured outputs, settings |
| **Agent Orchestration** | LangGraph | 1.2+ (`langgraph`, `langchain-core`) | Multi-agent state machines, cyclical graphs, checkpointing |
| **Primary LLM** | Google Gemini 3.1 Flash Lite (`gemini-3.1-flash-lite`) | `google-genai` SDK (v2.32+) | Planning, claim extraction, fact checking, report synthesis |
| **Embeddings** | Google `text-embedding-004` (768d) | `google-genai` SDK | Passage vectorization (retrieval document & query modes) |
| **Database & Vector Store** | PostgreSQL 16 + `pgvector` | Supabase Cloud / local Postgres | Relational data + 768-dim HNSW indexed passage vectors |
| **Database ORM** | SQLAlchemy 2.0 (Async) | `asyncpg` driver | Async DB models, relationships, and queries |
| **Migrations** | Alembic | 1.14+ | Schema migrations with pgvector index management |
| **Web Search** | DuckDuckGo (`duckduckgo-search`) | `DDGS` async wrapper | Real-time search query execution with rate limit handling |
| **Web Scraping** | `httpx` + `BeautifulSoup4` | Async HTTP + BS4 | SSRF-safe page fetching and clean HTML text extraction |
| **Background Jobs** | In-process `asyncio` tasks | Native Python | Run execution off the main request thread (replaces Redis/ARQ) |
| **Realtime Events** | FastAPI Server-Sent Events (SSE) | SSE protocol | Live agent streaming events (`agent_started`, `source_found`, etc.) |
| **Testing** | `pytest`, `pytest-asyncio` | Modern fixtures | Unit and integration testing with mocked network calls |
| **Code Quality** | `ruff`, `mypy` | Strict typing | Static analysis, formatting, and type-safety verification |

